ible objectifs Sony E</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1041\"><strong data-start=\"1016\" data-end=\"1039\">5. Sony Alpha a9 II</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1nnwnkz\" data-start=\"1042\" data-end=\"1078\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1044\" data-end=\"1078\">Mirrorless plein format, 24,2 MP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1v08c14\" data-start=\"1079\" data-end=\"1113\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1081\" data-end=\"1113\">Vidéo 4K 30p, autofocus Eye AF</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"lifnzv\" data-start=\"1114\" data-end=\"1146\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1116\" data-end=\"1146\">Stabilisation interne 5 axes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1c9u8jt\" data-start=\"1147\" data-end=\"1178\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1149\" data-end=\"1178\">Compatible objectifs Sony E</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1206\"><strong data-start=\"1180\" data-end=\"1204\">6. Sony Alpha a7R IV</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"unzizg\" data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1241\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1209\" data-end=\"1241\">Mirrorless plein format, 61 MP</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ie09tb\" data-start=\"1242\" data-end=\"1276\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1244\" data-end=\"1276\">Vidéo 4K, autofocus performant</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"lifnzv\" data-start=\"1277\" data-end=\"1309\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1279\" data-end=\"1309\">Stabilisation interne 5 axes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1c9u8jt\" data-start=\"1310\" data-end=\"1341\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1312\" data-end=\"1341\">Compatible objectifs Sony E</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1360\"><strong data-start=\"1343\" data-end=\"1358\">7. Nikon Z9</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1507\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"14zj8ip\" data-start=\"1361\" data-end=\"1397\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1363\" data-end=\"1397\">Mirror