\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Canon EOS R Series</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Canon EOS DSLR</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Nikon Z Series</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Nikon DSLR</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Sony Alpha Series</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Fujifilm X Series</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Panasonic Lumix Series</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 6K</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Blackmagic PYXIS</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Apple iPhone USB-C</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Apple iPhone Lightning</span> (avec adaptateur DJI) / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Smartphones Android USB-C</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">PC Windows</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Mac</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Tablettes USB-C</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">DJI USB-C Phone Adapter</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">DJI Lightning Phone Adapter</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Câble Audio TRS 3,5 mm</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Câble USB-C</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Bonnette Anti-Vent DJI Mic</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Aimant de Fixation DJI</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Clip de Fixation DJI</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Étui de Charge DJI Mic</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">RØDE Lavalier GO</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">RØDE Lavalier II</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">DJI Lavalier Microphone</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">BOYA BY-M1 Pro II</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">BOYA BY-M3</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Deity W.Lav Pro</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Saramonic LavMicro U3</span> / <span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU14q_Emphasis\" data-w-component=\"bold\" data-w-default-strong=\"\" data-w-inline=\"\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\">Casque Audio 3,5 mm</span>.</p><br />\r\n<p class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text\" data-w-component=\"text\" data-w-wrap=\"normal\"><strong><span class=\"zlAe0W_TextBase zlAe0W_Text rFU1