ble avec :</strong> Rode VideoMicro Compact On-Camera Microphone / Rode VideoMic GO Ultra-Compact Shotgun Microphone / Rode VideoMic GO II Ultra-Compact Shotgun Microphone / Rode VideoMic Pro On-Camera Shotgun Microphone / Rode VideoMic Pro+ On-Camera Shotgun Microphone / Rode Stereo VideoMic Pro Stereo On-Camera Microphone / Rode Stereo VideoMic X Stereo On-Camera Microphone / Rode VideoMic Me Directional Microphone for Smartphones / Rode VideoMic Me-C USB-C Smartphone Microphone / Rode VideoMic Me-L Lightning Smartphone Microphone / Rode VideoMic NTG Hybrid Analog and USB Shotgun Microphone / Rode smartLav+ Lavalier Microphone / Rode SC4 TRS Female to TRRS Male Adapter / Rode SC6 Dual TRRS Input and Headphone Output Adapter / Rode SC6-L Mobile Interface for iOS Devices / Apple iPhone avec prise 3,5 mm ou adaptateur Lightning vers 3,5 mm / Apple iPad avec prise 3,5 mm ou adaptateur compatible / Smartphones Android avec prise TRRS 3,5 mm / Tablettes Android avec prise TRRS 3,5 mm / Casques et écouteurs avec connecteur TRRS 3,5 mm</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1667\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1049\" data-end=\"1064\">Similaire :</strong> Rode SC1 3.5 mm TRRS Extension Cable / Rode SC3 TRRS to TRS Adapter / Rode SC4 TRS Female to TRRS Male Adapter / Rode SC7 TRS to TRRS Patch Cable / Rode SC10 Right-Angle TRRS Cable / Rode SC11 Right-Angle TRS Y-Splitter Cable / Rode SC12 Coiled TRRS Cable / Rode SC13 TRRS to TRS Adapter Cable / Rode SC15 USB Type-C to Lightning Cable / Rode SC16 USB Type-C to USB Type-C Cable / Rode SC17 USB Type-C to USB Type-C Cable / BOYA BY-CIP2 TRS to TRRS Adapter Cable / Saramonic SR-C2003 TRS to TRRS Adapter Cable / Deity TRRS Audio Cable / UGREEN 3.5 mm TRRS Audio Cable / SmallRig 3.5 mm TRRS Audio Cable</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"></div>\