 Softbox 60x90 Bowens</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Strip Softbox 30x120 Bowens</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox QR-P70 Parabolic Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox QR-P90 Parabolic Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox QR-P120 Parabolic Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Neewer 24x36 Softbox Bowens Quick Release</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Neewer 90cm Octa Softbox Bowens</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Neewer 120cm Lantern Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Neewer Square Softbox 60x60 Bowens</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>SmallRig RA-D85 Parabolic Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>SmallRig RA-D60 Mini Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>SmallRig RA-D120 Parabolic Softbox</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>SmallRig FP-90 Folding Softbox</span></div></div>\n<ul>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"1357\" data-end=\"1478\"><strong>les projecteurs similaires </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"1550\" data-end=\"2036\">GoPro Hero 13 / 12 / 11 / 10 / 9 / 8 / 7 / 6 / 5 / DJI Osmo Action 5 Pro / 4 / 3 / 2 / Insta360 X4 / X3 / ONE RS / ONE R / Ace Pro / Ace / DJI Pocket 3 / DJI Pocket 2 / AKASO EK7000 / Brave 8 / SJCAM SJ11 / Sony ZV-1 / Sony ZV-E10 / Sony A7 III / A7 IV / A7S III / Sony FX3 / FX30 / Canon EOS R / R5 / R6 / Nikon Z6 / Z7 / Z8 / Fujifilm X-T4 / X-T5 / Panasonic GH5 / GH6 / Blackmagic Pocket Cinema Camera 4K / 6K / RED Komodo / Canon C70 / any camera with 1/4\"-20 mount or cage system</p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1-copy-3 (1).jpg\" alt=\"Projecteur Amaran 300C RGB - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/2-copy-3 (1).jpg\" alt=\"Projecteur Amaran 300C RGB - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/3-copy-3 (1).jpg\" alt=\"Projecteur Amaran 300C RGB - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div></div></div>',8900.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Lumières / Matériel de studio',3,'images/products/1-copy-3 (1).jpg',500,500,'medium','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(196,'SONY Type C - FZ100','WINA-19259','sony-type-c-fz100','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p><strong>SONY Type C - FZ100</strong> : Batterie haute capacité pour appareils Sony Alpha...</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-specs-block mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h me-2 text-danger\"></i>Spécifications Techniques Officielles</h3><div class=\"pdp-specs-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-weight-hanging\"></i> Poids</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">80 g</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-ruler-combined\"></i> Dimensions</div><div cl