pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/c-3.jpg\" alt=\"Insta360 2-in-1 Invisible Selfie Stick + Tripod - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div></div></div>',690.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires Insta360',14,'images/products/a-2.jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(265,'Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick','WINA-19694','insta360-extra-long-selfie-stick','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p><strong data-start=\"583\" data-end=\"619\">Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick</strong> : Obtenez des prises de vue aériennes sans drone...</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-specs-block mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h me-2 text-danger\"></i>Spécifications Techniques Officielles</h3><div class=\"pdp-specs-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-weight-hanging\"></i> Poids</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Environ 365 g</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-ruler-combined\"></i> Dimensions</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Extensible jusqu&#039;à 3 mètres (replié : environ 36 cm)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Résolution</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">NA (non applicable)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-video\"></i> Vidéo</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Effet invisible pour des prises de vue immersives</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-notch\"></i> Monture d&#039;objectif</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Compatible avec Insta360 X3, ONE X2, ONE RS, ONE R et autres</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><p data-start=\"29\" data-end=\"592\">Le <strong data-start=\"32\" data-end=\"68\">Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick</strong> est conçu pour les créateurs de contenu qui souhaitent capturer des perspectives uniques et dynamiques. Grâce à sa longueur impressionnante, il permet d’obtenir des prises de vue aériennes et des effets spectaculaires en mode troisième personne, sans avoir besoin d’un drone. Léger et robuste, il est compatible avec les caméras <strong data-start=\"398\" data-end=\"410\">Insta360</strong>, assurant une prise de vue stable et immersive tout en restant invisible dans les vidéos capturées avec des caméras 360°.</p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"674\" data-end=\"751\">Extensible pour capturer des perspectives immersives et spectaculaires...</li>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"752\" data-end=\"811\">Léger, robuste et compatible avec les caméras Insta360...</li>\r\n</ul></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/a-15.webp\" alt=\"Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/b-17.webp\" alt=\"Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/c-16.webp\" alt=\"Insta360 Extra Long Selfie Stick - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div></div></div>',1390.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires Insta360',14,'images/products/a-15.webp',780,780,'medium','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(266,'Insta360 Motorcycle Bundle','WINA-19699','insta360-motorcycle-bundle','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>pack complet qui contient la caméra Insta360 X4</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-specs-block mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h me-2 text-danger\"></i>Spécifications Techniques Officielles</h3><div class=\"pdp-specs-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-weight-hanging\"></i> Poids</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Variable selon les accessoires inclus</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-ruler-combined\"></i> Dimensions</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Adaptées aux différentes fixations moto</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Résolution</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">NA (non applicable)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-video\"></i> Vidéo</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Optimisé pour des prises de vue stables et dynamiques</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-notch\"></i> Monture d&#039;objectif</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Compatible avec Insta360 X3, ONE X2, ONE RS, ONE R et autres</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><p data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"368\">C’est un pack complet qui contient la caméra Insta360 X4 (360° en 8K) avec des accessoires spécialement conçus pour une utilisation sur moto.<br data-start=\"292\" data-end=\"295\" />Il permet de fixer facilement la caméra et de filmer pendant la conduite.</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"370\" data-end=\"373\" />\r\n<p data-section-id=\"14ct5i3\" data-start=\"375\" data-end=\"407\"><strong>Contenu du bundle (principal)</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"408\" data-end=\"439\">Le pack inclut généralement :</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ehbgck\" data-start=\"441\" data-end=\"482\">\r\n<p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"482\">Caméra Insta360 X4 (vidéo 360° en 8K)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1mq3ri6\" data-start=\"483\" data-end=\"516\">\r\n<p data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"516\">Perche Invisible Selfie Stick</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"10xkx7d\" data-start=\"517\" data-end=\"568\">\r\n<p data-start=\"519\" data-end=\"568\">Support de fixation pour moto (guidon ou cadre)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1xumegq\" data-start=\"569\" data-end=\"609\">\r\n<p data-start=\"571\" data-end=\"609\">Système de montage (clamp ou U-bolt)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"v2xrme\" data-start=\"610\" data-end=\"652\">\r\n<p data-start=\"612\" data-end=\"652\">Protections de lentilles (lens guards)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"10vwcl8\" data-start=\"653\" data-end=\"675\">\r\n<p data-start=\"655\" data-end=\"675\">Batterie d’origine</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"680\" />\r\n<p data-section-id=\"1gidtow\" data-start=\"682\" data-end=\"726\"><strong>Caractéristiques principales de la caméra</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"99uwbs\" data-start=\"727\" data-end=\"747\">\r\n<p data-start=\"729\" data-end=\"747\">Vidéo 360° en 8K</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1n6k0m5\" data-start=\"748\" data-end=\"785\">\r\n<p data-start=\"750\" data-end=\"785\">Stabilisation avancée (FlowState)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"g3pvo8\" data-start=\"786\" data-end=\"831\">\r\n<p data-start=\"788\" data-end=\"831\">Résistance à l’eau (jusqu’à environ 10 m)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"t8xo1f\" data-start=\"832\" data-end=\"864\">\r\n<p data-start=\"834\" data-end=\"864\">Autonomie d’environ 2 heures</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"17y8ijp\" data-start=\"865\" data-end=\"913\">\r\n<p data-start=\"867\" data-end=\"913\">Contrôle via smartphone (application Insta360)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"915\" data-end=\"918\" />\r\n<p data-section-id=\"1qylxz9\" data-start=\"920\" data-end=\"946\"><strong>À quoi sert ce bundle</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"947\" data-end=\"973\">Ce pack est conçu pour :</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"21rmim\" data-start=\"975\" data-end=\"1005\">\r\n<p data-start=\"977\" data-end=\"1005\">Filmer des trajets en moto</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1rpteee\" data-start=\"1006\" data-end=\"1034\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1008\" data-end=\"1034\">Faire du vlog en roulant</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1vxdd0q\" data-start=\"1035\" data-end=\"1075\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1075\">Obtenir des angles variés sans drone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fc899f\" data-start=\"1076\" data-end=\"1139\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1078\" data-end=\"1139\">Capturer toute la scène en 360° et choisir le cadrage après</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1141\" data-end=\"1144\" />\r\n<p data-section-id=\"1ppfp93\" data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1172\"><strong>Audio et connectivité</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1173\" data-end=\"1206\">La caméra est compatible avec :</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ha99h4\" data-start=\"1208\" data-end=\"1250\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1210\" data-end=\"1250\">Casques Bluetooth (type intercom moto)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"z6y3td\" data-start=\"1251\" data-end=\"1273\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1253\" data-end=\"1273\">Écouteurs sans fil</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"57x6f5\" data-start=\"1274\" data-end=\"1307\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1276\" data-end=\"1307\">Smartphones Android et iPhone</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n\r\n<hr data-start=\"1309\" data-end=\"1312\" />\r\n<p data-section-id=\"l90akv\" data-start=\"1314\" data-end=\"1336\"><strong>Points importants</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1lnwbvh\" data-start=\"1337\" data-end=\"1407\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1339\" data-end=\"1407\">Il faut bien fixer le support pour éviter les vibrations ou chutes</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1f0funs\" data-start=\"1408\" data-end=\"1466\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1410\" data-end=\"1466\">Une carte mémoire rapide (V30 minimum) est recommandée</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1f1c0is\" data-start=\"1467\" data-end=\"1536\">\r\n<p data-start=\"1469\" data-end=\"1536\">L’effet 360° peut créer une légère déformation, ce qui est normal</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"150\" data-end=\"235\">Le <strong data-start=\"153\" data-end=\"183\">Insta360 Motorcycle Bundle</strong> fonctionne avec la plupart des caméras Insta360 :</p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"363\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fh9a40\" data-start=\"237\" data-end=\"252\">\r\n<p data-start=\"239\" data-end=\"252\">Insta360 X4</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"fh9hmf\" data-start=\"253\" data-end=\"268\">\r\n<p data-start=\"255\" data-end=\"268\">Insta360 X3</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"5gi5jm\" data-start=\"269\" data-end=\"288\">\r\n<p data-start=\"271\" data-end=\"288\">Insta360 ONE X2</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"gbw5nk\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"316\">\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"316\">Insta360 ONE RS / ONE R</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"ocbups\" data-start=\"317\" data-end=\"342\">\r\n<p data-start=\"319\" data-end=\"342\">Insta360 GO 3 / GO 3S</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1rdweqe\" data-start=\"343\" data-end=\"363\">\r\n<p data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"363\">Insta360 Ace Pro</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-section-id=\"h6wgcw\" data-start=\"118\" data-end=\"143\"><strong>Articles similaires</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"2coqjq\" data-start=\"145\" data-end=\"287\">\r\n<p data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"287\"><strong data-start=\"147\" data-end=\"194\">Kit moto universel (GoPro / Insta360 / DJI)</strong><br data-start=\"194\" data-end=\"197\" />→ Compatible avec plusieurs marques, plus flexible</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1l331dt\" data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"425\">\r\n<p data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"425\"><strong data-start=\"291\" data-end=\"324\">Insta360 Motorcycle Mount Kit</strong><br data-start=\"324\" data-end=\"327\" />→ Version proche officielle avec fixations casque + guidon</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"1kmmz2z\" data-start=\"427\" data-end=\"564\">\r\n<p data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"564\"><strong data-start=\"429\" data-end=\"466\">Insta360 Motorcycle Extension Kit</strong><br data-start=\"466\" data-end=\"469\" />→ Ajoute une extension + sécurité (câbles, adaptateurs)</p>\r\n</li>\r\n 	<li data-section-id=\"pr8am7\" data-start=\"566\" data-end=\"692\">\r\n<p data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"692\"><strong data-start=\"568\" data-end=\"603\">RideMount (support moto avancé)</strong><br data-start=\"603\" data-end=\"606\" />→ Fixation très stable directement sur la moto</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/2222 (2).jpg\" alt=\"Insta360 Mo