=\"741\">Godox ML II-C4</strong> vous garantit des résultats de qualité.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/a-23.jpg?fit=1424%2C1429&amp;ssl=1\"><img src=\"/images/products/a-23.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n<strong>Compatible Avec :</strong> Godox ML100Bi II / Godox ML100R / Godox ML60IIBi / Godox ML60IIBi Kit / Godox ML30 / Godox ML30Bi / Godox AK-B01 Support de Batterie / Godox AK-R21 Projection Attachment / Godox AK-R22 Collapsible Diffuser / Godox ML-SF30 Softbox / Godox ML-SF50 Softbox / Godox ML-CS1625 Lantern Softbox / Godox ML-GB Adaptateur Godox Mount vers Bowens / Godox Mini Reflector / Godox Barn Doors pour ML Series / Godox Snoot pour ML Series / Godox Fresnel Lens pour ML Series / Godox Light Stand 190F / Godox Light Stand 260T Air Cushioned / Light Stand 2 m / Light Stand 2.7 m / Light Stand 3 m / C-Stand / Boom Arm / Support Spigot 5/8\" / Adaptateur Secteur Godox / Batterie V-Mount (avec support compatible) / Power Bank USB-C PD / Godox Light APP / Sac de Transport Godox.\r\n\r\n<strong>Les Similaires :</strong> Godox ML II-C2 Boîtier / Godox CB20 Carrying Bag / Godox CB22 Carrying Bag / Godox CB57 Carrying Case / Godox CB70 Carrying Bag / Godox CB74 Carrying Case / Godox CB75 Carrying Bag / Godox CB76 Carrying Case / Godox CB77 Carrying Bag / Godox CB79 Carrying Case / Nanlite Carrying Case for Forza Series / Aputure Carrying Case for LS Series / SmallRig Carrying Case / Neewer Carrying Case for LED Lights / K&amp;F Concept Hard Carrying Case / NiceFoto Carrying Case</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/d-11.jpg\" alt=\"Godox ML II-C4 B