t-hanging\"></i> Poids</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Environ 144 g par unité</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-ruler-combined\"></i> Dimensions</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">81 × 76 × 64 mm par unité</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-video\"></i> Vidéo</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Idéal pour la macrophotographie et les prises de vue rapprochées</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-notch\"></i> Monture d&#039;objectif</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Compatible avec divers adaptateurs d&#039;objectifs macro</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Résolution</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">NA (microphone avec support de montage)</div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\">Le <strong data-start=\"36\" data-end=\"59\">Godox Flash MF12-K2</strong> est un kit de flash macro conçu spécialement pour les photographes souhaitant capturer des <strong data-start=\"151\" data-end=\"182\">détails précis et éclatants</strong> en macrophotographie. Idéal pour les prises de vue de petits sujets comme les insectes, les fleurs ou les bijoux, il offre une <strong data-start=\"310\" data-end=\"339\">lumière douce et uniforme</strong> qui réduit les ombres indésirables. Ce kit comprend <strong data-start=\"392\" data-end=\"412\">deux unités MF12</strong>, permettant une disposition flexible autour de l\'objectif pour une <strong data-start=\"480\" data-end=\"514\">meilleure couverture lumineuse</strong>. Compatible avec le système sans fil Godox 2.4 GHz, le <strong data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"593\">Godox Flash MF12-K2</strong> est <strong data-start=\"598\" data-end=\"633\">polyvalent, compact et puissant</strong>, répondant aux besoins des professionnels et des amateurs exigeants.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\"><a href=\"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1652520-REG/godox_mf12_k2_mf12_macro_flash_2_light.html\" rel=\"attachment wp-att-28387\"><img src=\"https://winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/1657544573_IMG_1792435-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\">\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12 Macro Flash</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Macro Flash 2-Light Kit</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Canon Version</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Nikon Version</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Sony Version</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Fujifilm Version</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF12-K2 Olympus Panasonic Version</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF-AR Mounting Ring</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF11C Color Effects Set</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox MF11T Color Temperature Adjustment Set</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Adapter Ring 49mm</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Adapter Ring 52mm</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Adapter Ring 55mm</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Adapter Ring 58mm</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Adapter Ring 62mm</span></div></div>\n<ul>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\"><strong>les similaires </strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-start=\"33\" data-end=\"781\">Yongnuo YN24EX / Yongnuo YN14EX II / Canon Macro Twin Lite MT-26EX-RT / Canon Macro Ring Lite MR-14EX II / Nikon R1C1 Wireless Close-Up Speedlight System / Nikon SB-R200 / Olympus STF-8 Macro Flash / Sony HVL-MT24AM / Meike MK-MT24 / Meike FC-100 Macro Ring Flash / Nissin MF18 Macro Ring Flash / Nissin MF60 Macro Flash / Godox MF-R76 Macro Ring Flash / Godox ML-150 II Macro Ring Flash / Godox Ring72 Macro LED Light / Godox MF12 / Godox MF12-K4 / Godox MF12-DK1 Dental Flash Kit / Neewer RF1 Macro Ring Flash / K&amp;F Concept KF-150 Macro Ring Flash / Bolt VM-160-V2 LED Macro Ring Light / Sigma EM-140 DG Macro Flash / Sigma EM-140 DG NA i-TTL / Metz Mecablitz 15 MS-1 Digital / Venus Laowa Macro Twin Flash KX-800 / Voking VK-110 Ring Flash / Pixel Mago Macro Flash / Sunpak Auto 16R Pro Ring Flash / FalconEyes Macro Ring Flash / Andoer Macro Ring Flash / Travor RF-550D Macro Ring Flash / Aputure Amaran Halo LED Ring Flash / Godox X3 Trigger / Godox XPro II Trigger / Godox X2T Trigger / AK Diffuser for Godox MF12 / TurtleDove Diffuser for Godox MF12 / MF-CB Adapter with Godox AK-R11 Dome Diffuser / Godox AK-R13 Diffuser / Canon RF 100mm F2.8L Macro IS USM / Nikon Z MC 105mm f/2.8 VR S / Sony FE 90mm F2.8 Macro G OSS / Laowa 65mm F2.8 2X Ultra Macro / Sigma 105mm F2.8 DG DN Macro / Tamron SP 90mm Macro / Fujifilm XF 80mm F2.8 Macro / OM System M.Zuiko 90mm Macro IS Pro</p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperç