- Baxxtar Pro LP-E6NH Battery Kit - Patona Platinum LP-E6NH - Generic LP-E6NH Compatible Battery for Canon EOS R Series - Universal LP-E6NH Replacement Battery Pack for Canon Cameras</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</section></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none -mt-px h-px translate-y-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom)-14*var(--spacing))]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div>\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none translate-y-(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom) R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars min-h-(--gutter-remaining-height,0px) group-data-stream-active/scroll-root:h-[calc(var(--thread-response-height)-16*var(--spacing))]\"></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/777.jpg\" alt=\"K&amp;amp;F Concept LP-E6NH Batterie pour Camera Canon - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/b-39.jpg\" alt=\"K&amp;amp;F Concept LP-E6NH Batterie pour Camera Canon - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/c-41.jpg\" alt=\"K&amp;amp;F Concept LP-E6NH Batterie pour Camera Canon - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</di