nt et n\'importe où.</li>\r\n 	<li>Fonctionne aussi comme une batterie externe d\'urgence pour votre téléphone ou tablette.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/404_aa212791-13a1-4a2d-adf1-c4ec65eb71b6.webp?fit=1280%2C1280&amp;ssl=1\"><img src=\"/images/products/404_aa212791-13a1-4a2d-adf1-c4ec65eb71b6.webp\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\r\n<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"1216\"><strong data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"19\">Compatible avec</strong> : Insta360 X5 / Insta360 X5 Batterie Rechargeable / Insta360 X5 Fast Charge Hub / Insta360 X5 USB-C Cable / Chargeur USB-C PD 30 W / 45 W / 65 W / Adaptateur secteur USB-C Power Delivery / Power Bank USB-C PD / Insta360 X5 Quick Reader / Insta360 X5 Carry Case / Insta360 X5 Battery Case / Insta360 X5 Standard Lens Guards / Insta360 X5 Premium Lens Guards / Insta360 X5 Invisible Dive Case / Insta360 X5 Mic Adapter / Insta360 X5 Quick Release Mount / Insta360 X5 Vertical-Horizontal Mount / Insta360 X5 Selfie Stick / Insta360 70 cm Invisible Selfie Stick / Insta360 114 cm Invisible Selfie Stick / Insta360 120 cm Invisible Selfie Stick / Insta360 3 m Extended Edition Invisible Selfie Stick / Insta360 Bullet Time Handle 2.0 / Insta360 Tripod / Insta360 All-Purpose Tripod / Insta360 Backpack Clip / Insta360 GPS Preview Remote / Insta360 GPS Action Remote / Carte mémoire microSD UHS-I V30 / V60 (SanDisk Extreme / SanDisk Extreme PRO / Lexar Professional 1066x / Samsung PRO Plus / Samsung PRO Ultimate / Kingston Canvas Go! Plus) / Sac de transport Insta360 / Valise de protection pour Insta360 X5 / K&amp;F Concept Chargeur Hub pour Insta360 X5 / Accessoires USB-C compatibles Power Delivery.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1851\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"1218\" data-end=\"1236\">Les similaires</strong> : Insta360 X5 Fast Charge Hub / Insta360 X4 Fast Charge Hub / Insta360 X3 Fast C