azy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/4-13.jpg\" alt=\"NiceFoto VB-1000A - Vue connectiques &amp; accessoires\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue connectiques & accessoires</div></div></div></div>',4490.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Lumières / Matériel de studio',3,'images/products/3-23.jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(556,'NiceFoto VB-2000A','VB‑2000A','nicefoto-vb-2000a','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>Panneau LED rectangulaire avec <strong data-start=\"997\" data-end=\"1017\">softbox intégrée</strong></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-specs-block mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h me-2 text-danger\"></i>Spécifications Techniques Officielles</h3><div class=\"pdp-specs-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-weight-hanging\"></i> Poids</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">environ 1,5 kg (variable selon version exacte)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-ruler-combined\"></i> Dimensions</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">Version carrée : env. 50 × 50 cm\n\nVersion rectangulaire : env. 35 × 60 cm</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-tag\"></i> Réglage de la lumière</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">2700K → 6500K (bi-couleur)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-tag\"></i> Alimentation</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">module externe (AC / batterie selon options)</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-expand\"></i> Résolution</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">NA (no