era Tripod / Wireless Remote Control for Light / Power Cable / Portable Power Bank / Rechargeable Batteries / USB‑C to Power Adapter / Background Stand / Backdrop Clamps / Spring Clips / Gaffer Tape / Carrying Case / LED Strip Accent Lights / Reflector Panel</p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/yy (1).jpg\" alt=\"NICEFOTO DF80-1000A - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/yyyyyy.jpg\" alt=\"NICEFOTO DF80-1000A - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div></div></div>',1990.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Lumières / Matériel de studio',3,'images/products/yy (1).jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(561,'NiceFoto DS80-1000B','DS80-1000B','nicefoto-ds80-1000b','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>NiceFoto KT-DS80-1000B Kit Lumière Parapluie Portable Premier Mondial 100W Nouveauté Éclairage Photographique</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-specs-block mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-sliders-h me-2 text-danger\"></i>Spécifications Techniques Officielles</h3><div class=\"pdp-specs-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-bolt\"></i> Puissance</div><div class=\"pdp-spec-value\">~ 80 W — suffisant pour éclairer sujets proches ou scènes de taille moyenne</div></div><div class=\"pdp-spec-card\"><div class=\"pdp-spec-label\"><i class=\"fas fa-palette\">