&amp;F Concept KF13.167 – Sling Bag 1L Nature Wander (Black) est un sac bandoulière ultra-compact de 1 L, fabriqué en EVA et PU résistants à l\'eau, avec intérieur rembourré, séparateur modulable, fermeture zippée et plusieurs modes de transport, idéal pour une caméra d\'action, un appareil photo compact et les accessoires essentiels.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong>Les Similaires :</strong> K&amp;F Concept KF13.168 Sling Bag 1L Nature Wander (Beige) / K&amp;F Concept KF13.169 Sling Bag 1L Nature Wander (Grey) / K&amp;F Concept Alpha Sling 4L KF13.130 V1 / K&amp;F Concept Sling Bag 6L / K&amp;F Concept Sling Bag 10L Nature Wander KF13.157 / PGYTECH OneGo Solo 3L / Peak Design Everyday Sling 3L / WANDRD Rogue Sling 3L / Lowepro GearUp Creator Box / Lowepro Adventura SH 120 III / Think Tank Mirrorless Mover 10 / Manfrotto Advanced Holster III / Ulanzi Camera Sling Bag / Neewer Camera Sling Bag / BAGSMART Camera Sling Bag / Caden Camera Sling Bag.</p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1-64.jpg\" alt=\"K&amp;amp;F Concept - KF13.167 – Sling Bag 1L Nature Wander  &quot;Black&quot; - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/2-58.jpg\" alt=\"K&amp;amp;F Concept - KF13.167 – Sling Bag 1L Nature Wander  &quot;Black&quot; - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/3