erie en option à montage en V</li><br />\r\n 	<li>IRC 96 | ICFT 96</li><br />\r\n 	<li>Contrôle à bord et de l’application</li><br />\r\n 	<li>0-100% Gradation, 11 effets d’éclairage</li><br />\r\n 	<li>Comprend adaptateur secteur et cordon</li><br />\r\n 	<li>Comprend les portes et le boîtierLe plus puissant de la gamme Godox LP</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n<div id=\"product-description-short-5184594\" class=\"product-description-short typo sm-bottom\"><a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/r.webp?fit=1742%2C1800&amp;ssl=1\"><img src=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/r.webp?fit=1742%2C1800&amp;ssl=1\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div><br />\r\n<div><br />\r\n<div class=\"sld-product-accessories-types2\"><br />\r\n<div id=\"libelle_declinaison_courante\"></div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\" data-voice-floating-orb-focus-background=\"\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:84e2ec87-e73e-42bf-859a-8a1d41410903-23\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:84e2ec87-e73e-42bf-859a-8a1d41410903-23\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:84e2ec87-e73e-42bf-859a-8a1d41410903-23\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-48\" data-turn=\"assistant\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"t