class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/KF31.188-2-1200x1200-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Protective Case for Insta-360 X5 - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/KF31.188-3-1200x1200-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Protective Case for Insta-360 X5 - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/KF31.188-4-1200x1200-1.jpeg\" alt=\"Protective Case for Insta-360 X5 - Vue connectiques &amp; accessoires\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue connectiques & accessoires</div></div></div></div>',250.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/Design-sans-titre-10.jpg',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(643,'Magnetic Neck Phone','SKU.2288','magnetic-neck-phone','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>K&F Concept SKU.2288 Hands-Free POV/Vlog Magnetic Neck & Chest Mount for All Types of Action Cameras & Smartphones</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><p class=\"pdp-clean-p\"><strong>K&amp;F Concept Action Camera Magnetic Neck Mount Price in Bangladesh</strong><br />\r\n<p class=\"\" data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"293\"><strong data-start=\"220\" data-end=\"293\">Capture Life from Your Perspective – Hands-Free, Effortless, Magnetic. </strong>Experience a new level of convenience and freedom with the <strong data-start=\"354\" data-end=\"398\">K&amp;F Concept SKU.2288 Magnetic Neck Mount</strong>, designed for <strong data-start=\"413\" data-end=\"460\">all types of action cameras and smartphones</strong>. Whether you’re walking, biking, vlogging, or live streaming, this mount allows you to record stable, first-person footage — completely hands-free.</p><br />\r\n<p data-sourcepos=\"3:1-3:350\">Revolutionize your point-of-view (POV) content creation with the K&amp;F Concept SKU.2288 Magnetic Neck Mount. <span class=\"citation-71\">This innovative and versatile mount allows you to securely and comfortably wear your action camera or smartphone around your neck, capturing immersive, hands-free footage and photos from a unique chest-level perspective. </span>Perfect for vlogging, tutorials, cooking demonstrations, outdoor adventures, and more, this magnetic neck mount offers a stable and convenient way to record your activities without the need for bulky harnesses or tripods. Its strong magnetic attachment ensures your device stays securely in place while allowing for quick and easy adjustments.</p><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"638\" data-end=\"666\">Universal Compatibility:</strong> Works with GoPro, DJI Osmo Action, Insta360, and smartphones (with magnetic or clamp adapter).</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"768\" data-end=\"793\">Strong Magnetic Hold:</strong> Dual-sided magnetic plates offer a firm, secure grip on your device — even during movement.</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"892\" data-end=\"920\">Comfortable Neck Design:</strong> Ergonomic and lightweight for all-day wear without fatigue.</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"987\" data-end=\"1013\">True First-Person POV:</strong> Ideal angle for immersive storytelling and real-time content creation.</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"763\"><strong data-start=\"1091\" data-end=\"1117\">Quick Setup &amp; Removal:</strong> Easy to mount and dismount your camera or phone without tools.</li><br />\r\n 	<li class=\"\" data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"887\"><strong>Strong Magnetic Attachment:</strong> Features powerful magnets that provide a reliable and stable hold for your device.</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"887\"><strong>Easy to Attach and Detach:</strong> <span class=\"citation-70 citation-end-70\">The magnetic design allows for quick and effortless mounting and unmounting camera or smartphone.</span></li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"887\"><strong>Ideal for Various Activities:</strong> Perfect for vlogging, cooking, DIY projects, outdoor adventures, live streaming, and more.</li><br />\r\n 	<li data-start=\"764\" data-end=\"887\"><strong>Durable Construction:</strong> Built with high-quality materials to ensure long-lasting performance.</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/general-pro-Egypt-KF-concept-Magnetic-Neck-Phone-Mount-for-iPhone-Action-Cameras-SKU2288-14.jpeg?fit=518%2C518&amp;ssl=1\"><img src=\"/images/products/general-pro-Egypt-KF-concept-Magnetic-Neck-Phone-Mount-for-iPhone-Action-Cameras-SKU2288-14.jpeg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br />\r\n<div><br />\r\n<div class=\"flex h-svh w-screen flex-col\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"relative z-0 flex min-h-0 w-full flex-1\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 w-full min-w-0 flex-1\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"relative flex min-h-0 min-w-0 flex-1\" data-side-pane-shell-host=\"true\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"@container/main relative flex min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col -translate-y-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)] pt-[calc(env(safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)/2)]\"><br />\r\n<div class=\"@w-sm/main:[scrollbar-gutter:var(--stage-scroll-gutter)] tou