otation design, rotate to find the best shooting angle you wan</li><br />\r\n</ul><br />\r\n<p class=\"classyunicodedone\"><strong>Package Includes</strong></p><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Chest Mount</li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Backpack Clip</li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Head Strap</li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Wrist Strap</li><br />\r\n 	<li><strong>5 x Thumb Screw</strong></li><br />\r\n 	<li><strong>4 x J-type Quick Release Buckle</strong></li><br />\r\n 	<li><strong>1 x 1/4\" Screw Adapter</strong></li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Cell Phone Clip</li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Vertical Adapter</li><br />\r\n 	<li>1 x Manual.</li><br />\r\n</ul></p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/Design-sans-titre-12.jpg\" alt=\"Head Strap &amp;amp; Chest Mount - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/SKU.2289-2-1200x1200__47694.jpeg\" alt=\"Head Strap &amp;amp; Chest Mount - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/SKU.2289-3-1200x1200__93481.jpeg\" alt=\"Head Strap &amp;amp; Chest Mount - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/SKU.2289-