e à utiliser] La méthode de fixation est simple et facile à utiliser, garantissant la stabilité et la sécurité de votre équipement d\'éclairage pendant l\'utilisation.</li>\r\n 	<li>* [Facile à transporter] Le Supports d\'éclairage photographique peut être plié et est livré avec un sac de rangement, ce qui est très approprié pour le stockage et les voyages.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<a href=\"https://i0.wp.com/winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/KF34.041-5-1200x1200-3.jpeg?fit=1200%2C1200&amp;ssl=1\"><img src=\"/images/products/KF34.041-5-1200x1200-3.jpeg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>LED Video Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>LED Panel Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Ring Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Softbox Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Umbrella Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Flash Strobe</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Speedlite Flash</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>COB LED Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>RGB LED Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Tube LED Light</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Reflector 5‑in‑1</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Diffuser Panel</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Barndoor Light</span><span class=\"