tart=\"0\" data-end=\"37\">SmallRig 1/4\" Double End Stud 828</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"39\" data-end=\"129\">Le DoubleHeadStud 1/4\"-1/4 est équipé d’un filetage standard 1/4\"-20 à chaque extrémité.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"207\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Il est compatible avec tous les accessoires disposant d’un filetage 1/4\"-20.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"207\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><a href=\"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1422148-REG/smallrig_828_double_head_stud_with.html\"><img src=\"https://winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1531395907_IMG_1025857-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></p>\r\n\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li data-start=\"131\" data-end=\"207\">\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 5D Mark IV</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS R5</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS R6</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS R7</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon D850</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon Z6 II</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon Z7 II</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon Z8</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony A7 III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony A7 IV</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony A7R V</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX3</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX30</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Fujifilm X-T4</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Fujifilm X-T5</span></div></div>\n<p class=\"pdp-clean-p\"></div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"></div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n</div><br />\r\n</section></div><br />\r\n<div class=\"pointer-events-none h-px w-px absolute bottom-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-edge=\"true\"></div></p></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1531395907_IMG_1025858.jpg\" alt=\"Goujon double extrémité SmallRig 1/4&quot;-20 à 1/4&quot;-20 (paquet de 2) - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1531395907_IMG_1025856.jpg\" alt=\"Goujon double extrémité SmallRig 1/4&quot;-20 à 1/4&quot;-20 (paquet de 2) - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div></div></div>',90.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/1531395907_IMG_1025858.jpg',500,500,'medium','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(780,'Pare-soleil SmallRig pour Sony a7S III/a7C/ZV-1/FX3','3206','pare-soleil-smallrig-pour-sony-a7s-iiia7czv-1fx3','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>Le pare-soleil SmallRig <b>pour appareils photo Sony a7S III/a7C/ZV-1/FX3 est conçu pour s\'adapter aux écrans LCD orientables de ces appareils.</b></p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><div class=\"productDescription_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n\r\n<b><span dir=\"auto\">Il protège l\'écran LCD de la lumière directe </span></b><b><span dir=\"auto\">,</span></b><span dir=\"auto\"> évitant ainsi les reflets et les éblouissements, pour une visualisation optimale des images. Fabriqué avec un extérieur en cuir robuste et un intérieur en microfibre, ce pare-soleil se glisse rapidement sur l\'écran LCD et se fixe à l\'aide de bandes auto-agrippantes. Ses quatre bords intérieurs surélevés empêchent la rotation du pare-soleil et assurent une meilleure stabilité lors de son utilisation. La protection intégrale offre une protection optimale même en conditions de forte luminosité, et la partie inférieure flexible permet d\'accéder à l\'écran tactile LCD.</span>\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1636552-REG/smallrig_sunhood_for_sony_alpha.html/overview\"><img src=\"https://winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1619701212_IMG_1526960-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"featureHeader_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div><strong><span dir=\"auto\">Appareils photo compatibles</span></strong></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Sony / Alpha 7S III / a7S3<br data-start=\"257\" data-end=\"260\" />Sony / Alpha 7C<br data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"278\" />Sony / ZV-1<br data-start=\"289\" data-end=\"292\" />Sony / ZV-E1<br data-start=\"304\" data-end=\"307\" />Sony / ZV-E10<br data-start=\"320\" data-end=\"323\" />Sony / FX3<br data-start=\"333\" data-end=\"336\" />Sony / FX30<br data-start=\"347\" data-end=\"350\" />Sony / Alpha 7 IV / a7IV<br data-start=\"374\" data-end=\"377\" />Sony / ZV-1 II / ZV-1F</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>les similaires</strong> SmallRig sunhood écran LCD / sun hood pour caméra / pare-soleil écran articulé universel / sunhood monitor SmallHD / sunhood Feelworld / sunhood Neewer / sunhood Ulanzi / sunhood Tilta / sunshade monitor rig / LCD hood DSLR universel / monitor sunshade 5 pouces / monitor sunshade 3.5 pouces / monitor sunshade 7 pouces / SmallHD sunhood 5 inch Focus series / Feelworld monitor sun hood / Atomos Ninja V sun hood / Atomos Shinobi sun hood / Desview monitor sun hood / Tiltaing universal sunhood / Ulanzi CM03 monitor hood / Neewer LCD sunshade monitor / camera cage sun hood compatible / external monitor sunshade rig / DSLR video monitor hood compatible Sony Canon Nikon Fujifilm Panasonic Blackmagic DJI / universal flip screen sun hood for camera monitors</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm pb-25\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:80edb4dd-7870-496c-8044-6038c62c004c-6\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-14\" data-scroll-anchor=\"true\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\"