 Fabriqué principalement en alliage d\'aluminium, le RA-S200 possède des pieds en silicone antidérapants supportant jusqu\'à 4 kg. Une fois replié, il ne mesure que 56 cm et se range facilement dans son sac de transport. Sa rotule entièrement métallique incluse offre un contrôle directionnel précis.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1792891-REG/smallrig_4379_ra_s200_light_stand.html/overview\"><img src=\"https://winashop.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1698660949_IMG_2109533-300x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\r\n</a><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li></p>\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL60W</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL60II Bi</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL100D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL100Bi</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL150II</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox SL200III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox ML60</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox ML100Bi</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Litemons LA150R</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Godox Litemons LA200Bi</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Aputure Amaran 60d</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Aputure Amaran 60x</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Aputure