lerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1715936427_IMG_2247735-1.jpg\" alt=\"Câble SmallRig 3042B Micro-HDMI vers HDMI (13,8&quot;) - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1715936427_IMG_2247736.jpg\" alt=\"Câble SmallRig 3042B Micro-HDMI vers HDMI (13,8&quot;) - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1715936427_IMG_2247737.jpg\" alt=\"Câble SmallRig 3042B Micro-HDMI vers HDMI (13,8&quot;) - Vue ergonomie &amp; commandes\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue ergonomie & commandes</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1715936427_IMG_2247738.jpg\" alt=\"Câble SmallRig 3042B Micro-HDMI vers HDMI (13,8&quot;) - Vue connectiques &amp; accessoires\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue connectiques & accessoires</div></div></div></div>',190.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/1715936427_IMG_2247735-1.jpg',500,500,'medium','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(802,'Câble SmallRig Mini-HDMI vers HDMI (13,8\")','3040','cable-smallrig-mini-hdmi-vers-hdmi-138','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>Connectez proprement votre moniteur à votre caméra grâce à ce câble SmallRig Mini-HDMI vers HDMI de 35 cm . </p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enric