class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"featureHeader_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><span dir=\"auto\">Supports d\'accessoires multiples</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\"><span dir=\"auto\">Fixez plusieurs accessoires à l\'aide du support de griffe porte-accessoires, des filetages 1/4\"-20 et 3/8\"-16 et des filetages anti-torsion 3/8\"-16.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"featureHeader_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div><span dir=\"auto\">Montage à double orientation</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div class=\"hasRightMedia_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"isImage_UbV5SNP5Eo media_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"lazyload-wrapper \"><a href=\"https://www.bhphotovideo.com/c/product/1767618-REG/smallrig_4124_cage_kit_for_sony.html/overview\"><img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/rich_content/desktop/1684768510_IMG_1999213.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\"><span dir=\"auto\">La plaque latérale modulaire permet un montage horizontal et vertical pour une utilisation sur les réseaux sociaux.</span></div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"featureHeader_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong><span dir=\"auto\">Plaque de batterie à montage en V</span></strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"\">\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><span dir=\"auto\">Utilisez la plaque et le câble D-Tap inclus pour alimenter votre FX6 à l\'aide d\'une batterie à monture V.</span></li>\r\n 	<li><span dir=\"auto\">Compatible avec les batteries Sony BP-U.</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"isImage_UbV5SNP5Eo media_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div c