t doté d\'une vis moletée de serrage pour une fixation aisée des accessoires, et des coussinets en caoutchouc protègent votre matériel et facilitent le serrage des vis.</span>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"featureHeader_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div><a href=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1626870641_IMG_1575504.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1626870641_IMG_1575504.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>SmallRig 2066B Articulating Arm 11 inch 1/4\"-20 Compatible avec</strong> SmallRig 2065B Articulating Arm 5.5 inch / SmallRig 5309 Magic Arm Support 11 inch / SmallRig 5310 Magic Arm with Crab Clamp 7 inch / SmallRig 5311 Magic Arm with Crab Clamp 11 inch / SmallRig 3873 Dual Ball Head Magic Arm / SmallRig 3875 Magic Arm NATO / SmallRig 2143B Magic Arm Cold Shoe / SmallRig 3959 ARRI Rosette Magic Arm / SmallRig 4862 Super Clamp Magic Arm Kit / SmallRig 3757B Crab Clamp Super Clamp Kit / SmallRig 2164 Crab Clamp Magic Arm / SmallRig 3026 Camera Cage / SmallRig 3084 GoPro Cage / SmallRig 4088 Insta360 Cage / SmallRig 4119 DJI Action Cage / SmallRig Camera Cage A7 series / SmallRig Cage FX3 FX30 / SmallRig Cage Canon R5 R6 / SmallRig Cage Nikon Z8 Z6 / SmallRig Top Handle 3765 / SmallRig Side Handle 2093 / SmallRig NATO Rail 1409 / SmallRig Cheese Plate 1681 / SmallRig Monitor Mount 2903 / SmallRig HDMI Cable Clamp 1822 / SmallRig Cold Shoe Mount 1241 / Manfrotto 244 Variable Friction Arm / Manfrotto 143N Magic Arm / Manfrotto 035RL Super Clamp / Kupo KCP-300 Articulated Arm / CAMVATE Crab Clamp Magic Arm / iFootage Spider Crab Arm / Tilta Articulating Arm / Neewer Super Clamp Arm / Ulanzi R096 Magic Arm / Falcam F22 Quick Release Arm / Falcam F38 Arm / NICEYRIG Magic Arm Clamp / 