e, un support ou un bâton d\'une épaisseur ou d\'un diamètre de 1,5 à 6,6 cm (0,6 à 2,6 pouces) et se verrouille à l\'aide d\'un large levier. L\'intérieur de chaque pince est revêtu de silicone pour une adhérence optimale.</span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1747403083_IMG_2495228.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1747403083_IMG_2495228.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li></p>\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A1</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A9 III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7R V</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7 IV</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7S III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7C II</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha FX3</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha FX30</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX6</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX9</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Burano</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Venice</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony ZV-E1</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony ZV-E10</span><s