/p>\r\n<p data-start=\"40\" data-end=\"1322\">Manfrotto Super Clamp 035 / Manfrotto Nano Clamp 386B / Manfrotto 275 Mini Clamp / Kupo Super Viser Clamp KG602912 / Kupo Super Convi Clamp / Avenger C1575B Super Clamp / Matthews Matthellini Clamp / Matthews Super Mafer Clamp / Matthews Infinity Arm Clamp System / Tilta Adjustable Super Clamp / Tilta Mini Clamp Mount / Tilta Rod Clamp System / Ulanzi R094 Super Clamp / Ulanzi R095 Clamp Mount / Ulanzi R099 Magic Arm Clamp / Falcam F22 Super Clamp / Falcam Crab Clamp Kit / Nitze Super Clamp with Ball Head Arm / Nitze Crab Clamp System / CAMVATE Super Clamp / CAMVATE Rod Clamp Mount / CAMVATE Magic Arm Clamp Kit / NICEYRIG Super Clamp / NICEYRIG Crab Clamp / iFootage Super Clamp / iFootage Spider Crab Clamp Arm / Wooden Camera Unified Clamp System / Zacuto Z-Clamp / Shape Super Clamp Mount / Benro Super Clamp / Sirui Clamp Mount System / Neewer Super Clamp / Neewer Heavy Duty Clamp / Andoer Super Clamp / Fotga Super Clamp / K&amp;F Concept Super Clamp / Desview Clamp Mount / Accsoon Clamp Arm Mount / DJI Expansion Clamp Mount / Zhiyun TransMount Clamp / Moza Multi Clamp Mount / FeiyuTech Accessory Clamp / GoPro Jaws Flex Clamp / PGYTECH Action Camera Clamp / Insta360 Heavy Duty Clamp / Elgato Multi Mount Clamp / Rode PSA1 Desk Clamp / Peak Design Capture Clamp System</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/winashop-32.png\" alt=\"Pince SmallRig Super Clamp pour tiges de 10 à 55 mm - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1545840944_IMG_1116795.jpg\" alt=\"Pince SmallRig Super Clamp pour tiges de 10 à 55 mm - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div></div></div>',490.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/winashop-32.png',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(945,'Pince en forme de crabe SmallRig 5319','5319','pince-en-forme-de-crabe-smallrig-5319','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>The <b>Crab-Shaped Clamp</b> from <b>SmallRig</b> can be clamped onto any rod, round pipe, table, handlebar, or tripod leg with a width of up to 2\" to provide a mounting option for any device, such as a camera, LED light, or monitor.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><p class=\"pdp-clean-p\">The aluminum alloy clamp features anti-slip pads to protect the mounted gear from serious damage or simple scratches, and the multitude of 1/4\"-20 threaded holes and locating holes facilitate the mounting of various types of devices.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1743154508_IMG_2461387.jpg\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li></p>\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A1</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A9 III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7R V</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7 IV</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha A7S III</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX3</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX30</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX6</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony FX9</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Burano</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Venice</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony ZV-E1</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony ZV-E10</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony A6700</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony A6600</span></div></div></div></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-visual-showcase\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-camera-retro me-2 text-danger\"></i>Aperçu Visuel & Galerie Officielle</h3><div class=\"pdp-showcase-grid\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/winashop-33.png\" alt=\"Pince en forme de crabe SmallRig 5319 - Vue principale face\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue principale face</div></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-card\"><div class=\"pdp-showcase-img-wrap\"><img src=\"/images/products/1743154508_IMG_2461388.jpg\" alt=\"Pince en forme de crabe SmallRig 5319 - Vue de profil détaillée\" loading=\"lazy\"></div><div class=\"pdp-showcase-caption\"><i class=\"fas fa-check-circle text-success me-1\"></i>Vue de profil détaillée</div></div></div></div>',290.00,NULL,NULL,10,2,1,0.00,10,2,'Accessoires',10,'images/products/winashop-33.png',1000,1000,'high','active','2026-10-22 15:08:21','2026-10-22 15:08:21'),(946,'SmallRig Super Clamp with 1/4\"-20 and 3/8\"-16 Threads (Pair)','2058','smallrig-super-clamp-with-14-20-and-38-16-threads-pair','<div class=\"pdp-enrich-lead mb-4\"><p>Mount a camera, monitor, light, or other accessory on a rod system with the <b>Super Clamp with 1/4\"-20 and 3/8\"-16 Threads</b> from <b>SmallRig</b>, available here in a pack of two.</p></div>\n\n<div class=\"pdp-enrich-body mb-4\"><h3 class=\"pdp-enrich-heading\"><i class=\"fas fa-circle-check me-2 text-danger\"></i>Présentation & Caractéristiques Détaillées</h3><div class=\"pdp-body-text\"><div class=\"productDescription_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n\r\nDesigned to fit any rod sized 15 to 44mm, the clamp is equipped with a T-shaped locking lever and has anti-slip rubber pads inside the jaw to ensure a snug and secure fit while protecting your equipment. Additionally, 1/4\"-20 and 3/8\"-16 threaded mounting holes on the back of the clamp enable you to further expand your rig.\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"descriptionAsTitle_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">Universal compatibility—enables stable mounting of cameras, lights, umbrellas, hooks, shelves, plate glass, cross bars, or additional Super Clamps on 15 to 44mm rods</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"descriptionAsTitle_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">1/4\"-20 and 3/8\"-16 threaded mounting holes</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"feature_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"descriptionAsTitle_UbV5SNP5Eo\">\r\n<div class=\"js-injected-html text_UbV5SNP5Eo\">Lightweight aluminum alloy construction</div>\r\n<div><a href=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1545237928_IMG_1114185.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1545237928_IMG_1114185.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></div>\r\n<div>\r\n<div class=\"relative basis-auto flex-col -mb-(--composer-overlap-px) pb-(--composer-overlap-px) [--composer-overlap-px:28px] grow flex\">\r\n<div class=\"flex flex-col text-sm\">\r\n<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto [content-visibility:auto] supports-[content-visibility:auto]:[contain-intrinsic-size:auto_100lvh] R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-height))] scroll-mt-[calc(var(--header-height)+min(200px,max(70px,20svh)))]\" dir=\"auto\" data-turn-id=\"request-WEB:46b1aaed-72f3-43f0-8fb3-a910f0c03db3-18\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:46b1aaed-72f3-43f0-8fb3-a910f0c03db3-18\" data-testid=\"conversation-turn-38\" data-scroll-anchor=\"false\" data-turn=\"assistant\">\r\n<div class=\"text-base my-auto mx-auto pb-10 [--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-xs,calc(var(--spacing)*4))] @w-sm/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-sm,calc(var(--spacing)*6))] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-margin:var(--thread-content-margin-lg,calc(var(--spacing)*16))] px-(--thread-content-margin)\">\r\n<div class=\"[--thread-content-max-width:40rem] @w-lg/main:[--thread-content-max-width:48rem] mx-auto max-w-(--thread-content-max-width) flex-1 group/turn-messages focus-visible:outline-hidden relative flex w-full min-w-0 flex-col agent-turn\">\r\n<div class=\"flex max-w-full fle