t même d\'autres pinces. Son ouverture maximale est de 40 mm et sa ouverture minimale de 15 mm. Elle se fixe et se détache rapidement d\'un moniteur, dont la position est ajustable selon vos besoins pendant la prise de vue.</span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Charge utile maximale : 1,5 kg</span></strong><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Compatibilité :</span></strong><br />\r\n<span dir=\"auto\">15 mm à 40 mm</span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Contenu de l\'emballage :</span></strong><br />\r\n<span dir=\"auto\">1 x support de fixation,</span><br />\r\n<span dir=\"auto\">1 x vis 1/4\"-20,</span><br />\r\n<span dir=\"auto\">1 x clé hexagonale.</span><br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Poids net :</span></strong><span dir=\"auto\"> 200 g.</span><br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Dimensions de l\'emballage :</span></strong><span dir=\"auto\"> 105 × 95 × 30 mm.</span><br />\r\n<strong><span dir=\"auto\">Matériau :</span></strong><span dir=\"auto\"> alliage d\'aluminium.</span><br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://static.smallrig.com/mall/img/public/1650458912496_1124-03.jpg?x-oss-process=image/format,webp\"><img src=\"https://static.smallrig.com/mall/img/public/1650458912496_1124-03.jpg?x-oss-process=image/format,webp\" alt=\"Catégorie/Supports de montage/Super Clamps Support Super Clamp | Rotule 1/4 pouce | Support pour moniteur LED - Réf. : 1124/Poids du colis (kg) : 0,35/\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br />\r\n<div class=\"relative w-full overflow-visible\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none [--shadow-height:45px] has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none has-data-writing-block:-mt-(--shadow-height) has-data-writing-block:pt-(--shadow-height) [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_threadScrollVars scroll-mb-[calc(var(--scroll-root-safe-area-inset-bottom,0px)+var(--thread-response-