supporte une charge utile maximale de 5 kg et est fourni avec un support pour téléphone et un sac de rangement. Un niveau à bulle intégré permet d\'obtenir un horizon parfait, tandis que les options de fixation 1/4\"-20 et 3/8\"-16 assurent une large compatibilité avec de nombreux accessoires photo courants.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&nbsp;<br />\r\n<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1750931783_IMG_2518494.jpg\"><img src=\"https://static.bhphoto.com/images/multiple_images/images500x500/1750931783_IMG_2518494.jpg\" alt=\"\" / class=\"pdp-diagram-img img-fluid rounded-3 shadow-sm\" loading=\"lazy\"></a><br />\r\n<ul><br />\r\n 	<li class=\"font-claude-response-body break-words whitespace-normal leading-[1.7]\"></p>\n<div class=\"pdp-compatibility-card\"><div class=\"fw-bold text-dark mb-2\"><i class=\"fas fa-link text-success me-2\"></i>Compatibilité Officielle & Écosystème Recommandé :</div><div class=\"pdp-compat-tags\"><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 90D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 850D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 4000D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 250D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Canon EOS 2000D</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon D3500</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon D5600</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon D7500</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Nikon D780</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Sony Alpha 68</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Pentax K-70</span><span class=\"pdp-compat-tag\"><i class=\"fas fa-check me-1\"></i>Pentax KF</span><