 / Manfrotto PIXI / SmallRig Mini Tripod / Ulanzi MT-16 / Joby GorillaPod / DJI Grip Tripod</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"409\" data-end=\"577\"><strong>Batteries compatibles</strong> / Canon NB-13L / Canon NB-15L / Chargeur Canon CB-2LH / USB PD-E1 / USB PD-E2 / SmallRig NP-F Battery System</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"769\"><strong>Cartes mémoire compatibles</strong> / SanDisk Extreme Pro SDXC UHS-I / Lexar Professional 1066x / Samsung Pro Plus / Kingston Canvas React Plus / Sony Tough SDXC</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"771\" data-end=\"937\"><strong>Éclairages compatibles</strong> / Godox V1 Canon / Aputure MC / Ulanzi VL49 / SmallRig LED Light / Zhiyun Molus / Neewer RGB Pocket Light</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"1157\"><strong>Protections compatibles</strong> / Silicone Case / Leather Half Case / SmallRig Cage / Screen Protector Verre Trempé / Hard Travel Case / Wrist Strap / Neck Strap / Peak Design Capture Clip</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1159\" data-end=\"1383\"><strong>Accessoires vlog compatibles</strong> / Wireless Remote BR-E1 / Canon IFC-100U / USB Webcam Utility / HDMI Output Capture Card / Smartphone Holder / Cold Shoe Mount / Mini Ball Head / Selfie Grip</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1385\" data-end=\"1513\"><strong>Flashs compatibles</strong> / Canon HF-DC2 / Godox V1 Canon / Godox TT350C / Canon Speedlite EL-100</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"1515\" data-end=\"1678\"><strong>Sacs compatibles</strong> / Canon DCC-1950 / Lowepro Creator Box / Peak Design Everyday Sling / Ulanzi Camera Bag / PGYTECH OneGo Mini</p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\">\r\n<div class=\"qMYqUG_convSearchResultHighlightRoot\">\r\n<div class=\"\" data-turn-id-container=\"request-WEB:97cca871-c5e9-4fa0-9c9b-543007f0337d-3\" data-is-intersecting=\"true\"><section class=\"text-token-text-primary w-full focus:outline-none has-data-writing-block:pointer-events-none [&amp;:has([data-writing-block])&gt;*]:pointer-events-auto R6Vx5W_